  "headline": "Search Operation Ends at Bogor Illegal Mine Leaving 14 Missing",
  "seoTitle": "Bogor Illegal Mine Search Operation Concludes",
  "metaDescription": "Authorities have ceased the search for 14 miners trapped in an illegal gold mine in Pongkor, Bogor, following an incident that resulted in 13 confirmed…",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "Search and rescue operations at the Pongkor gold mine site have been officially terminated by Basarnas.",
    "A total of 27 individuals were reported involved in the incident, with 13 fatalities confirmed and 14 remaining missing.",
    "West Java Regional Police have identified two individuals as suspects in connection with the illegal mining activities."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "Emergency teams and Basarnas have formally concluded search efforts at an illegal gold mining operation located in the Pongkor area of Nanggung District, Bogor. The incident involved 27 miners who became trapped within the mine shafts. Of the total number affected, authorities have confirmed 13 deaths, while 14 individuals remain missing and unaccounted for. In response to the tragedy, the West Java Regional Police have launched an investigation into the operations and have designated two people as suspects. Further reports indicate that authorities have also uncovered illegal gold processing facilities disguised as farms, which are suspected of being linked to the illegal mining trade in the region. The search efforts faced significant operational challenges prior to the official decision to close the rescue mission.",
